  "title": "Vendor Load-In Post-Event Review Form",
  "subtitle": "Reconcile load-in performance, custody, exceptions, vendor coordination, and improvements before the event movement record is closed.",
  "description": "An original post-event review of vendor load-in planning and execution. It compares scheduled and actual movement, evaluates route and staging use, reconciles inventory and access records, analyzes incidents and delays, captures vendor feedback, assigns improvements, and closes the record.",
  "use_case": "Use after vendor load-in and related strike or collection are complete, especially for complex events or recurring vendors. Convert observed exceptions into owned improvements rather than informal lessons.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
